{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And you shall not flatter the land.</b> One who does evil in secret is called חנף (a flatterer/hypocrite)." "<b>And you shall not defile the land.</b> That is to say, the hypocrisy (חנופה) mentioned shall not defile the land. Or it may be a warning to each and every one of Israel, because I dwell within it — and not for the honor of the land, but for the honor of Israel and for My honor; therefore it says, ״אשר אני שוכן בתוכה״, and it says, ״כי אני ה׳ שוכן בתוך בני ישראל״."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:37:59.535041683Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}